[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3822637887","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115503#issuecomment-3822637887","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115503","id":3822637887,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7j2NM_","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-30T09:05:42Z","updated_at":"2026-01-30T09:05:42Z","body":"Hi, thank you for your report! I could not replicate this on KISS Linux (musl based) with an AMD iGPU (renoir), neither on niri 25.11 nor commit `f30db163`.\n\nI wonder if this might be related to your GPU drivers, given the persistent error. Does the `ERR_CANT_CREATE` error still show up if you run the editor with the `GODOT_WAYLAND_DISABLE_EMBEDDER` env var set to `1`?\n\nI'd be also interested in a full debug dump of the embedder layer. To do that you'll need to [compile the engine](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/engine_details/development/compiling/index.html) with the [`WAYLAND_EMBED_DEBUG_LOGS_ENABLED`](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/80a4af1cc7c97b41f819ac2ac519a12804a53b1c/platform/linuxbsd/wayland/wayland_embedder.cpp#L54)  macro defined.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3822637887/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3824106070","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115503#issuecomment-3824106070","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115503","id":3824106070,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7j7zpW","user":{"login":"vod3","id":22642893,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNjQyODkz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22642893?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3","html_url":"https://github.com/vod3","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-30T14:39:26Z","updated_at":"2026-01-30T14:39:26Z","body":"Using `GODOT_WAYLAND_DISABLE_EMBEDDER` I still get ` ERROR: drivers/vulkan/rendering_device_driver_vulkan.cpp:3511 - Condition \"err != VK_SUCCESS\" is true. Returning: ERR_CANT_CREATE`\n\nI will keep you updated with logs from the compiled version when it crashes.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/