","body":"Hi, this doesn't look like a debug log unfortunately :(\n\nDid you define the macro I linked above, by uncommenting it? Sorry if I wasn't clear in my explanation. If you do it correctly, you should get a hugeeee amount of stuff printed to text.\n\nI recommend piping it all into a log file as such, with also some extra debugging variables while you're at it:\n\n```sh\nWAYLAND_DEBUG=1 path/to/godot --verbose 2>&1 | tee embedder.log\n```\n\nPlease note that this being a protocol dump will also include any input sent to the editor.\n\nHope this helps :D","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3825127832/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3825471457","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115503#issuecomment-3825471457","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115503","id":3825471457,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kBA_h","user":{"login":"vod3","id":22642893,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNjQyODkz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22642893?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3","html_url":"https://github.com/vod3","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-30T19:57:16Z","updated_at":"2026-01-30T19:57:16Z","body":"Ok hopefully I did it right this time:\n\n<img width=\"3535\" height=\"2134\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a95ad30d-ccc9-4928-a38b-05fbd85a6d3e\" />\n\nThe logfile is huuuge, uncompressed over 1G. Its a xz archive, split into 2 parts. its not really a zip, just tricking github into getting it uploaded.\n\n[embedder.log.xz.part1.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24973230/embedder.log.xz.part1.zip)\n\n[embedder.log.xz.part2.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24973233/embedder.log.xz.part2.zip)\n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3825471457/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3828308023","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115503#issuecomment-3828308023","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115503","id":3828308023,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kL1g3","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-31T12:12:45Z","updated_at":"2026-01-31T12:39:15Z","body":"Hi, I've taken a first look. There are also a bunch of oddities here and there but it will take a deeper look to figure them out.\n\nI think I have found an FD leak. Its symptoms do not line completely with what you've described though. Does the editor crash by itself after a while or is it completely stable as long as you don't embed the game? I'm not sure I have a clear image of what happens and would appreciate a more detailed explanation.\n\nAdditionally, to isolate the issue further, I think that I'll need some more \"high-level\" info:\n\n - First of all, what is the version of your drivers? This might sound a little trivial but NVIDIA drivers are notorious for being quirky and still somewhat rough with Wayland.\n - Can you replicate this on OpenGL?\n - Does the Vulkan error still happen if you use the X11 backend?\n - Does this happen with another compositor, like sway?\n - If I understand correctly, your CPU also mounts an iGPU, but it's not detected by Godot. If it's actually there (e.g. just disabled) and if it's not too annoying to get it up, perhaps you could give that a shot?\n\nI'll also make a patch for the FD leak, perhaps that'll help. The ever-present Vulkan error is somewhat worrying though.\n\nThank you for your patience!","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3828308023/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3829054452","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115503#issuecomment-3829054452","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115503","id":3829054452,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kOrv0","user":{"login":"vod3","id":22642893,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNjQyODkz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22642893?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3","html_url":"https://github.com/vod3","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-31T18:53:18Z","updated_at":"2026-01-31T19:00:43Z","body":"I'm almost sure its the combination of NVIDIA with vulkan and wayland.\nSometimes I just watch the errors pile up in the bottom panel and without any input from my side it crashes. Until then a lot off the vulkan errors did stack up.\n\nDriver Version: 590.48.01 from arch repos.\n\n`godot --rendering-driver opengl3` in wayland is running stable without any errors multiple hours long.\n\n`godot --display-driver x11` with vulkan does not produce any vulkan errors. Runs stable so far.\n\nI tested hyprland and KDE, there the error with wayland and vulkan is the same.\n\nThe problem is my nvidia card always picks up all rendering tasks, regardless if monitors are connected to it or not. when only one HDMI is connected to the iGPU, it just delegates the calculations from my dedicated GPU trough itself to the monitor. don't know how to force the iGPU to render without disconnecting the nvidia one.\n\nBut on my laptop with intel iGPU (niri / wayland) there are no vulkan errors whatsoever, this must be an nvidia issue. \n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3829054452/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3829128300","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115503#issuecomment-3829128300","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115503","id":3829128300,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kO9xs","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-31T19:20:40Z","updated_at":"2026-01-31T19:34:27Z","body":"Welp, that combination is a bit cursed, as I said. Reminds me a bit of #88113.\n\nWhile there is an FD leak, if you can replicate the issue with the embedder disabled[^1] then I'm afraid that this might be unrelated to it entirely. If it really is a driver issue, I'm afraid that there's not a lot that we can do.\n\nPerhaps you could test other Wayland-native Vulkan things. vkcube-wayland comes to mind, along with any vulkan game written with a reasonably recent SDL. The most foolproof way is probably to run them from a terminal with `DISPLAY` unset (`unset DISPLAY`).\n\nHas this issue happened recently? [Arch recently switched to the \"open\" drivers](https://archlinux.org/news/nvidia-590-driver-drops-pascal-support-main-packages-switch-to-open-kernel-modules/), so maybe they introduced some bug. Perhaps downgrading to the 580xx-dkms version (as per the link) might help.\n\n[^1]: To double-check, try embedding a game with that environment variable set, it should always run windowed.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3829128300/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3829138112","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115503#issuecomment-3829138112","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115503","id":3829138112,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kPALA","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-31T19:24:25Z","updated_at":"2026-01-31T19:24:25Z","body":"Note that you might be able to select the iGPU on the command line with `--gpu-index <num>` passed to Godot (run `godot --rendering-driver vulkan --verbose` to see the list of detected \"Devices:\" and their index). Alternatively, you can force it in the environment with `VK_ICD_FILENAMES=/usr/share/vulkan/icd.d/intel_icd.x86_64.json` (assuming your iGPU is Intel, otherwise the relevant file in there).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3829138112/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3829193015","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115503#issuecomment-3829193015","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115503","id":3829193015,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kPNk3","user":{"login":"vod3","id":22642893,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNjQyODkz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22642893?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3","html_url":"https://github.com/vod3","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-31T19:46:37Z","updated_at":"2026-01-31T19:46:37Z","body":"> Perhaps you could test other Wayland-native Vulkan things. vkcube-wayland comes to mind, along with any vulkan game written with a reasonably recent SDL. The most foolproof way is probably to run them from a terminal with `DISPLAY` unset (`unset DISPLAY`).\n\nI played DOOM The dark ages under vulkan and KDE a few months ago, from start to finish without any crashes, its a vulkan game. NVIDIA really never bothered me since the 550 drivers, gaming is a bliss with it. New features like FrameGen and DLSS4 all run stable on my system. Only Godot in the embedded view seems to have massive issues with my system.\n\n`ERROR: Condition \"err != VK_SUCCESS\" is true. Returning: ERR_CANT_CREATE` is present even without the embedded view, but at least it was stable. I will continue to run the game as a separate window and see if it can remain stable.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3829193015/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3829290755","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115503#issuecomment-3829290755","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115503","id":3829290755,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kPlcD","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-31T20:29:34Z","updated_at":"2026-01-31T20:29:34Z","body":"> I played DOOM The dark ages under vulkan and KDE a few months ago, from start to finish without any crashes, its a vulkan game. NVIDIA really never bothered me since the 550 drivers, gaming is a bliss with it.\n\nYou likely used it under XWayland though. That stuff uses the old X11 graphics stack which is unaffected from these Wayland + Vulkan issues. That's why I recommended trying with `DISPLAY` unset (that's the X11 socket path).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3829290755/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3829293359","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115503#issuecomment-3829293359","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115503","id":3829293359,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kPmEv","user":{"login":"vod3","id":22642893,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNjQyODkz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22642893?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3","html_url":"https://github.com/vod3","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-31T20:31:41Z","updated_at":"2026-01-31T20:31:41Z","body":"true. i used to play the Quake 2 RTX demo, i remember it was wayland native. I will check it out again, and the other games with Display unset.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3829293359/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3829298121","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115503#issuecomment-3829298121","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115503","id":3829298121,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kPnPJ","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-31T20:35:49Z","updated_at":"2026-01-31T20:35:49Z","body":"> ERROR: Condition \"err != VK_SUCCESS\" is true. Returning: ERR_CANT_CREATE is present even without the embedded view, but at least it was stable. I will continue to run the game as a separate window and see if it can remain stable.\n\nEven when not embedding, the editor runs under a special \"shim\" that alters the way Wayland messages are handled. It can only be disabled with the environment variable.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3829298121/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3835959006","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115503#issuecomment-3835959006","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115503","id":3835959006,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kpBbe","user":{"login":"vod3","id":22642893,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNjQyODkz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22642893?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3","html_url":"https://github.com/vod3","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vod3/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/us